  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>For <math><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> to be defined, we must have<br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#8804;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8804;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#8804;</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#8804;</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>1</mn></msup></math> <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>as</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">h</mi><mi>e&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#8804;</mo><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#8804;</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mrow></mfenced></math><br />Now, <math><mn>1</mn><mo>&#8804;</mo><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#8805;</mo><mn>0</mn></math> i.e. <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8805;</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8804;</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></math> or <math><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8805;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mrow></mfenced></math><br />Also, <math><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#8804;</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>&#8804;</mo><mn>0</mn></math> i.e. <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8804;</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#8804;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8804;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mrow></mfenced></math><br />From Equation <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> and <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>, we get,</p><p>the domain of <math><mi>f</mi></math><math><mo>=</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfenced close=\"]\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#8734;</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8746;</mo><mfenced open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#8734;</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8745;</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2,2</mn></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><math><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8746;</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1,2</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>.</p>",
